    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "나는 그가 왜 그녀와 결혼하려는지 모르겠다",
      "text": "I can't imagine[think] why he wants to <b>marry</b> her. or It's a mystery to me why he wants to <b>marry</b> her."
